  "_commit": {
    "id": "88c23e809db6903adaf3ec4f2a80834ba75d88ca",
    "author": "Ossama Edbali <ossedb@gmail.com>",
    "committer": "Ossama Edbali <ossedb@gmail.com>",
    "message": "fix: convert MSn mzML alike with both engines and store the activation type (#11)\n\n- mzMLToParquet() accepts .mzML.gz and .mzXML.gz; run ids drop the\n  compression suffix.\n- engine = \"mzr\" applies MsBackendMzR's renames, so scanIndex is the\n  position, acquisitionNum the scan number and precScanNum resolves to\n  the parent; peaksCount and empty header fields are kept.\n- The first precursor's dissociation method is read from the mzML\n  <activation> elements by both engines into activationType, stored as\n  activation_type.\n- Add msn.mzML.gz, an MS1-MS4 acquisition with non-contiguous scan\n  numbers, and engine-equivalence tests against MsBackendMzR.\n- Version 0.99.12.\n",
    "time": 1795002546
  },
